# Plan: Add DocC Documentation to GuitarTap

## Objective
Add developer-level DocC documentation to all Swift source files using:
- Top-of-file `///` overview block per file/module
- Per-type, per-property, per-method `///` triple-slash comments
- Apple-standard DocC markdown: `- Parameters:`, `- Returns:`, `- Throws:`, `- Note:`, `- SeeAlso:`, `- Important:`, `- Warning:`, code blocks with ` ``` `
- Refinement of existing inline `//` comments for clarity and precision

## DocC Syntax Rules (Apple Standard)
```swift
/// Brief one-sentence summary.
///
/// Extended discussion paragraph(s). May include markdown.
///
/// ```swift
/// let example = foo()
/// ```
///
/// - Parameters:
///   - name: Description of this parameter.
/// - Returns: Description of return value.
/// - Throws: `ErrorType` when condition occurs.
/// - Note: Additional context.
/// - Important: Critical usage information.
/// - Warning: Dangerous or destructive behavior.
/// - SeeAlso: `RelatedType`
```

